<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>This<sp/>example<sp/>puts<sp/>the<sp/>device<sp/>into<sp/>IDLE<sp/>mode<sp/>and<sp/>then<sp/>wakes<sp/>up<sp/>the<sp/>device</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>from<sp/>IDLE<sp/>using<sp/>XINT1<sp/>which<sp/>triggers<sp/>on<sp/>a<sp/>falling<sp/>edge<sp/>of<sp/>GPIO0.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>The<sp/>GPIO0<sp/>pin<sp/>must<sp/>be<sp/>pulled<sp/>from<sp/>high<sp/>to<sp/>low<sp/>by<sp/>an<sp/>external<sp/>agent<sp/>for</highlight></codeline>
